<title>FINLAND: Bank of Finland details ERM intervention rates.</title>
<headline>Bank of Finland details ERM intervention rates.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland gave the following bilateral central parity and intervention rates for the markka in the ERM based on a peg at an ECU central parity rate of 5.80661:</p>
<p>		  Upper rate	 Central rate     Lower rate</p>
<p> 100 DEM	 353.008	    304.000	    261.801</p>
<p> 100 ATS	 50.1744	    43.2094	    37.2114</p>
<p> 100 BEF/LUF   17.1148	    14.7391	    12.6931</p>
<p> 100 DKK	 92.5438	    79.6976	    68.6347</p>
<p> 100 ESP	 4.14938	    3.57345	    3.07740</p>
<p> 100 FRF	 105.253	    90.6422	    78.0597</p>
<p> 1 IEP	   8.51107	    7.32960	    6.31217</p>
<p> 100 NLG	 313.295	    269.806	    232.353</p>
<p> 100 PTE	 3.44376	    2.96570	    2.55402</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
